#: blocks/toc-anchor/block.json
msgid "TOC Anchor"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/toc-anchor/block.json
msgid "Marks a point on this page to appear in the TOC & Progress bar. When any TOC Anchor blocks exist on a page, they replace automatic H2/H3 detection entirely for that page."
msgstr ""

#: blocks/toc-progress/block.json
msgid "TOC & Progress"
msgstr ""

#: blocks/toc-progress/block.json
msgid "Adds the combined table of contents and reading progress bar. Fixed to the bottom of the viewport regardless of where this block sits on the page; headings are pulled automatically from this page's H2/H3s."
msgstr ""

