msgid "Skip headings with this class"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-rptoc-settings.php:698
msgid "A single class name, no leading dot. Any heading carrying it is skipped: useful for a themed \"Related posts\" or \"Comments\" heading that would otherwise sit at the end of every table of contents on the site."
msgstr ""

